    1. Pick n in 3-5. Pick background=0, mask_color=8, and 4 distinct side colors from 1-7 minus 8.
    2. Build the (n+2)x(n+2) output frame with 4 colored bars on edges, bg corners.
    3. Generate a random n x n binary mask with density ~0.6-0.7. Ensure at least 1 pixel has a unique nearest side and at least 1 pixel is equidistant to >=2 sides.
