    5. Build input grid (14-16 x 15-16). Place the 4 frame bars in their open-rectangle layout (corners=bg, interior=bg) at a random position. Place the raw mask (all 8s) at a separate non-overlapping position with >=3 Chebyshev gap from frame bbox.
